menu "talk" "speed" "telephone" "keyboard" "mouse" "joystick" "screen" "CDROM" "music" "sounds"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "You want to speed up your computer? No prob..., I'll just double the frequency. Uh, you may want to move back a couple of yards..." choices "speed"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "Uh oh... Your computer can't take it|... It's about to implode... DANGER... THROW YOUR PC OUT THE WINDOW... DO IT NOW!!!" choices "speed"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "Phew! You're a lucky person... I managed to save the day.. You might care to mention that to Cap'n Bob|, when you see him..." choices "speed"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "To modify the ring tone of your onboard phone, stab your loudspeakers with a pair of scissors. For further modification, repeated stabbing may be necessary..." choices "telephone"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "To optimize your keyboard, gouge out excess keys with any commercial screwdriver..." choices "keyboard"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "For a more playful mouse, just replace the little mouse ball with a 6-sided die. Thanks Honk!!!" choices "mouse"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "This is a family game, Commander|!!! Put that nasty little joystick back where it came from!" choices "joystick"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "For sharper color and contrast, spit on your glasses and wipe them on somebody else. If everything looks green, that's because you are under attack from alien vampire cabbages..." choices "screen"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "So your CDROM is way too slow... What can I say?|... Next time, buy a circular saw or maybe an electric toothbrush...." choices "CDROM"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "You hate the music! That one's easy to fix. Just hit \"CONTROL ALT DEL\", and flip over the CD. That's better, isn't it?" choices "music"
say 0x0872 voice=0xFF flags=0x60 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "Seems like I'm sensing a fault in your sound card!!! Try hitting it awfully hard... It works for me..." choices "sounds"
yield_b
